WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.530
- Like the rest of the
world at this moment,

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.420
I'm obsessed with Dua Lipa.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.310
All right, she was, I mean, she's awesome,

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.230
so that's why.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.870
She was a battle round adviser
on The Voice last season

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:10.940
for team Kelly as well.

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.440
So she has great taste,
let's start with that

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.970
and she couldn't have been nicer.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.470
It's always nice to like meet
people you adore musically

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.470
and then they live up to
your expectations as a human

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.590
in real life.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.870
But the other day she
had a big announcement.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.200
It was so secret in fact,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.820
she called me before the audience

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.640
got into the house seats at our studio.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.990
So they couldn't hear yet either

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.580
and we can finally share
what she had to say.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.070
So check it out.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.250
Hey, what's up, Dua?

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.083
How you doing?

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:35.980
Where are you?

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.080
- I'm good, I'm in London.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.220
It's nice to see you, how are you?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.920
- I'm good actually, I'm great.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.860
Life is getting so much better, right?

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.565
So before, before I forget though,

00:00:46.565 --> 00:00:49.620
thank you so much for helping
team Kelly on The Voice.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:50.453
Did you have fun?

00:00:50.453 --> 00:00:51.680
You were so good at it.

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.430
- Oh, thank you, I had so much fun.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.240
It was definitely such a new experience,

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.900
but it was so cool to
get to learn next to you

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:00.011
and see the way that you mentor everyone

00:01:00.011 --> 00:01:02.850
was really amazing and
super inspiring, I loved it.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:03.750
- Oh man well, ditto,

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.030
you have such a great energy
about you, you're such a light.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.865
It was so fun and I
love your music so much.

00:01:07.865 --> 00:01:10.590
It was just, it was cool to
like love someone musically

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.483
and then you lived up like as a human.

00:01:12.483 --> 00:01:13.593
(laughing)
Like sometimes

00:01:13.593 --> 00:01:15.370
it doesn't always happen.
- Thank you.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:16.381
- Well, you have an announcement

00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:20.150
about your upcoming concert Studio 2054

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:23.010
so first what's happening at this concert?

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:26.260
- So it's an exclusive live performance,

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.443
but because I had to now
postpone my tour twice now,

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.810
I decided to do an online performance,

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.220
something that although
we can't all be together,

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.580
something that kind of
brings the party to you

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.820
and in that sense, I just wanted to create

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.390
a really unique experience,
build all these crazy sets,

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.510
something that I wouldn't
be able to do on tour

00:01:47.510 --> 00:01:51.150
and just have some fun
and have that, you know,

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.180
I've been missing so much
that human connection

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.220
and so it's, I think it's
gonna be nice to kind of

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.500
bring everyone together
in terms of the dancers

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.940
and the band and create a real fun,

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:05.420
you know, moment with
lots of guest appearances

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.440
and guest performers.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:08.420
and it'll be fun, I'm excited.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:09.660
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.850
- I am so excited to see
this, I'm not kidding.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:16.130
I think we're all craving like
any form of live performance

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:18.250
or, you know, I think we all
need that like right now.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.230
So I'm, it's the coolest idea.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.670
I'm so excited you're
doing it, but you today,

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:25.280
you're finally able to share
one of the big names, right?

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.079
That's gonna be a guest.

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:30.470
- Yeah, I'm really,
really excited to announce

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:33.963
that Miley Cyrus will
be joining me for this.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:35.673
- Oh my--
- She'll be

00:02:35.673 --> 00:02:37.520
one of the many special
guests I'm gonna have,

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.320
but she's a very, very,
very special guest.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.660
I'm so excited to have her.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.800
- Oh my gosh, that's so exciting,

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.080
I'm loving her whole new look.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.370
She's like doing the
whole John Jett thing,

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.887
I'm loving her whole new vibe, right now.

00:02:45.887 --> 00:02:46.870
- I know, she's sinister.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.080
- Yeah, she's like a little chameleon

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.240
every time she comes out new album,

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.930
I love how her vibe always changes

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.880
and her style and she pulls it off.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.160
That's gonna be so fun.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.050
I cannot wait to see that.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.300
It was nice to talk with you.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.421
I'm such a fan of you,
will you come by soon?

00:02:58.421 --> 00:02:59.507
- Thank you so much,

00:02:59.507 --> 00:03:02.475
Thank you for your time,
I've loved talking to you.

00:03:02.475 --> 00:03:04.530
Hopefully I'll see you again soon.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.007
- All right, bye Dua Lipa!

00:03:06.007 --> 00:03:06.907
Have a good one.

00:03:06.907 --> 00:03:08.074
- Bye, thanks.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:09.883
- All right y'all,

00:03:09.883 --> 00:03:12.330
tickets are on sale for
Dua Lipa's virtual concert

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.480
Studio 2054.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.470
You do not want to miss it.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:17.300
It streams November 27th on Live Now,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.400
it's gonna be amazing.

